        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Big Bass World Championship",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "BIG BASS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP places you into the world of competitive, professional fishing. Customize your tackle box and fishing style, then head out to Raccoon Lake and take on the pros in the Tournament mode. If the competition keeps stressing you out, go for a casual afternoon of relaxation in the Practice mode. No matter how you choose to play the game, the underwater camera will capture every second of fish fighting action. With all of the action and excitement of professional fishing, BIG BASS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP will keep all the future Hank Parker's of the world happy.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "BIG BASS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP te sumerge en el mundo de la pesca profesional y competitiva. Personaliza tu caja de aparejos y tu estilo de pesca, luego dirígete al lago Raccoon y enfréntate a los profesionales en el modo Torneo. Si la competencia te estresa, disfruta de una tarde casual y relajada en el modo Práctica. Sin importar cómo decidas jugar, la cámara submarina capturará cada segundo de la acción de lucha contra los peces. Con toda la emoción de la pesca profesional, BIG BASS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP mantendrá contentos a todos los futuros Hank Parker del mundo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1997",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
